## Title: Travel Wheel
## Author: clubwratt
## Version: 0.15.0
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## Description: Everything about travelling fast. Wheel entries (LibRadialMenu) for wayshrines, any house inside or outside, Cyrodiil, Imperial City and battleground queues, and Get Me Unstuck. Accepts ready queues at once or after a wait.
